---
import DocsLayout from '../../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Ringkasan">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#fafafa] mb-6">Ringkasan Produk</h1>
  <p class="text-[#a1a1aa] leading-relaxed mb-8">
    Wago adalah layanan mandiri yang ringan untuk menghubungkan akun WhatsApp melalui otentikasi QR dan menyediakan endpoint REST API untuk pengiriman pesan otomatis. Dibangun dengan Express, TypeScript, dan Baileys.
  </p>

  <hr class="border-[#1a1a1a] my-8" />

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-4">Fitur Utama</h2>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8">
    <div class="border border-[#1a1a1a] rounded-lg p-4">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-1">Autentikasi QR</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#71717a]">Autentikasi langsung via stream QR Baileys WhatsApp Web melalui browser atau terminal.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="border border-[#1a1a1a] rounded-lg p-4">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-1">Sesi Permanen</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#71717a]">Menyimpan kunci otentikasi di <code class="text-[#a1a1aa] bg-[#1a1a1a] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">/app/data/auth</code>, aman dari restart server dan Docker.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="border border-[#1a1a1a] rounded-lg p-4">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-1">Pengiriman Pesan</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#71717a]">Kirim pesan teks secara instan ke nomor penerima valid dengan normalisasi nomor otomatis.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="border border-[#1a1a1a] rounded-lg p-4">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-1">Keamanan API Key</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#71717a]">Penguncian otorisasi web bootstrap, cookie sesi HttpOnly, dan proteksi Bearer Token.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <hr class="border-[#1a1a1a] my-8" />

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-4">Normalisasi Nomor Telepon</h2>
  <p class="text-[#a1a1aa] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">Backend menormalisasi nomor telepon sebelum membuat JID WhatsApp:</p>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm text-[#a1a1aa] space-y-1.5 mb-8">
    <li>Menghapus spasi, tanda hubung, dan tanda <code class="text-[#a1a1aa] bg-[#1a1a1a] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">+</code>.</li>
    <li>Mengubah nomor lokal <code class="text-[#a1a1aa] bg-[#1a1a1a] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">08...</code> menjadi <code class="text-[#a1a1aa] bg-[#1a1a1a] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">628...</code>.</li>
    <li>Contoh: <code class="text-[#a1a1aa] bg-[#1a1a1a] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">0813-6563-0011</code> menjadi <code class="text-[#a1a1aa] bg-[#1a1a1a] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">6281365630011@s.whatsapp.net</code></li>
  </ul>

  <hr class="border-[#1a1a1a] my-8" />

  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#fafafa] mb-4">Keamanan</h2>
  <p class="text-[#a1a1aa] text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">Aplikasi menerapkan kontrol keamanan berlapis:</p>
  <div class="border border-[#1a1a1a] rounded-lg divide-y divide-[#1a1a1a] text-sm mb-8">
    <div class="p-4">
      <p class="font-medium text-[#fafafa] mb-1">Web Bootstrap</p>
      <p class="text-[#71717a]">Aktif saat <code class="text-[#a1a1aa] bg-[#141414] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">ALLOW_WEB_BOOTSTRAP=true</code>. Menghasilkan API key aman dan mengatur cookie HttpOnly.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="p-4">
      <p class="font-medium text-[#fafafa] mb-1">Autentikasi Bearer</p>
      <p class="text-[#71717a]">Endpoint terproteksi membutuhkan <code class="text-[#a1a1aa] bg-[#141414] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">Authorization: Bearer &lt;API_KEY&gt;</code>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
